{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act16side_level_act16side_st02",
  "groupId": "act16side",
  "stageId": "act16side_st02",
  "title": "Iris",
  "storyCode": "GA-ST-2",
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act16side/level_act16side_st02.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1ea5ebe73425cb67831aef31302990850f8b9332c6cefbada61c536802b3fd00",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sciurus",
      "text": "I was treating this like a holiday in Laterano... Never thought something like this would happen.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sciurus",
      "text": "Kjerag is a theocracy too, so why couldn't we have done this?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yucatan",
      "text": "Laterano is much more influential. The Legati were all part of the Apostle's plan.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yucatan",
      "text": "We simply don't have that sort of foundation.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sciurus",
      "text": "Influence, eh? It's only after leaving Kjerag that I learned how troublesome influence can be.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sciurus",
      "text": "Pretty amazing how Enciodes managed to negotiate with our neighboring countries all on his own.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yucatan",
      "text": "The Saintess's influence is on the rise too. We have our own advantages.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sciurus",
      "text": "But do you really think what the Lateran Pope is talking about is possible?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yucatan",
      "text": "I don't know.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yucatan",
      "text": "I can't imagine a world where all the nations are so tightly entwined with one another. It sounds like a dream, or maybe a nightmare.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yucatan",
      "text": "But no one can ignore the miracle that happened that day, or the Pope's speech.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yucatan",
      "text": "Is Laterano really the blessed city?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sciurus",
      "text": "What do the Sankta think of all this, Ezell?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "Huh? Well, er... it was stunning?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sciurus",
      "text": "Figured as much. Apparently, that bell has not rung for thousands of years.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sciurus",
      "text": "So what will happen to Laterano now?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "Perhaps not all that much, from what I know of the Laterans. Or maybe it's the same everywhere.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "Turning points in history don't always seem so important at the time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "But we do perceive that change is happening, and we'll take up our own duties and responsibilities.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sciurus",
      "text": "Well said, brother.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sciurus",
      "text": "You can leave us here. We have a car on the way.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yucatan",
      "text": "Thank you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "No problem. Cardinal Velliv is at a hospital not far from here. I'll be reporting back to her directly.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sciurus",
      "text": "Please give her our thanks.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "As long as you're satisfied. Those were her instructions.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sciurus",
      "text": "Nothing gets past her, huh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sciurus",
      "text": "Say, can you take a photo of me and my husband?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "Sure.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "How is that?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sciurus",
      "text": "You're a pretty good photographer.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yucatan",
      "text": "Thanks.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "You're welcome.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "text": "Say, Fiammetta, do you feel like your steps are heavier than usual?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "text": "Where's this coming from?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "text": "You don't feel a weight on your shoulders, after what His Holiness said?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "text": "Get to the point.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "text": "Well, I'm thinking I'm due for a career change. I'm not really cut out for a job with too much responsibility.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "text": "And you seem like just the girl to take my—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "text": "In your dreams.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "Good afternoon.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "text": "Long time no see, Ezell.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "It's only been two weeks...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "text": "Are you on a mission?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "An errand on behalf of Cardinal Velliv. I was just about to report back to her.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "This is my final task in Laterano.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "text": "Not bad. Once you've seen the world, you'll realize how boring this place is.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "text": "There aren't as many great desserts out there, but... life is about more than just enjoyment, don't you think?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "text": "So you're going to meet with Velliv? Where is she?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "Stevonus Central Hospital.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "text": "Let's go together then. We're headed the same way.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "Have you made up your mind?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "text": "Yes, I have.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "I thought you'd need to mull it over a little longer.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "text": "I just felt that I can't be the only one standing still, while everyone else has already taken the next step.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "Then I have nothing to add. I'm glad you accepted.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "It's wonderful to have someone like you join us, times being what they are.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "text": "I knew you'd be here, Velliv.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "How did you...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "text": "We ran into Ezell.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "The emissaries from Kjerag have reached their destination.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "Good work.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "But don't leave just yet. I've got another task I could use your presence for.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "Understood.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "See you next week, Lemuen.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "text": "See you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "text": "Have you decided to join the Seventh Tribunal, Lemuen?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "text": "Already on the job.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "text": "Hm, it won't be easy over there, after this conference.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "text": "Don't you think we're a match made in heaven though?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "text": "I suppose.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "text": "You've all chosen your paths. It's about time for me to think about what I can do too.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "text": "Speaking of, I was just talking to Fiammetta about quitting my job as a Legata.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "text": "Too much trouble?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "text": "I mean, with the old man? I can already see the trouble waiting in the future.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "text": "But you're not getting away that easily, Mostima. You answer to me now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "text": "Oh.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "text": "Here's your first job: bring this letter to El.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "text": "Can I say no?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "text": "Nope.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "text": "Deliver it to her personally.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "text": "Unemployment is sounding more appealing by the second.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "text": "Quit it with the lame excuses.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "text": "And there's my old taskmaster.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "text": "You won't give up.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "text": "How can you be so sure?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "text": "Don't pretend that you don't need this job.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "text": "You're looking for an answer, aren't you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "text": "I'm not Andoain.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "text": "I didn't say you were.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "text": "But you have a choice to make, about who you are.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "text": "And to find that answer... one must have journeyed far enough.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "text": "So how does it feel to be seen right through, Mostima? Sounds like you don't even need a halo to.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "text": "This is my own path, then. You shouldn't follow me, Fiammetta.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "text": "You think the world revolves around you? We just happen to be taking the same road.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "text": "I have his gun.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "text": "If he still sees himself as Sankta, he'll be back for it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "text": "Then he'll pay for what he did!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "text": "And you'll help me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "text": "Fine...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "text": "By the way, the Astray that were caught in the city have been set free.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "text": "Is that His Holiness's will?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "text": "Uh-huh.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "text": "His mercy is none of my business.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "text": "I thought you might say something like that.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "text": "Oh, and you'll be dispatched to Rhodes Island under the agreement with the Notarial Hall, through the Fifth Tribunal.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "text": "Er, you mean the pharmaceutical company that Mostima and Lemuel work part-time at?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "text": "Where's this coming from?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "text": "Velliv wants to deepen our cooperation. You're as good as anyone for the role.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "text": "Plus, we have a good track record with them. You should be well-supported.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "text": "Alright.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "text": "Oh, by the way, I have some really good news for you!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "text": "You get to choose from one of three code names for your next mission!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "text": "Do we really have to keep up this farce, now that you're our liaison?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "text": "We only used a temporary name in the first place because there's no clear role for keeping tabs on her.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "text": "I've had enough of these monthly name changes!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "text": "Didn't you like Shimmering Vigil? What was it that you said... 'they've finally come up with a decent name'?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "text": "Shut up.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "text": "Hey, nice flowers.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "text": "Hate to break it to you, but the tradition of changing your title has become a rule unto itself. Just accept it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lemuen",
      "text": "Here are your choices: Void Gourmet, Wasteland Pilot, or Dawn Destroyer.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "text": "...Dawn Destroyer.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "text": "Man, your tastes are so easy to guess.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fiammetta",
      "text": "I told you to shut up already!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "text": "*exhales*...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "You're awake?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "text": "Luck has really not been on my side lately.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "What's wrong? Getting bedsores from too much lying down?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "text": "No, forget I said anything.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "text": "Huh? Ezell?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "I wanted him to see what happens to those who come close to betraying Laterano.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "Er...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "text": "Stop bullying the kid, Velliv.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "Are you implying that I'm not young myself?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "text": "Sorry.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "You're no longer a Legatus.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "text": "If that's the price I must pay, then...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "But you're still my subordinate.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "text": "...it's a heavy one.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "You talk a big talk, Oren. Let's see what you learned in Victoria.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "text": "Does that mean you need me to do things my way?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "Remember that question you asked? I can answer it now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "I have no interest in being a woman of integrity.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "But I respect those who have worked hard to earn the title.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "text": "Well... I can't argue with that.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "Was that intended for me as well?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "Of course.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "Treasure the opportunity you've been given with Cecelia. Don't ever let me know what... influence she will have on Laterano.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "You don't want her returning here?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "If I didn't, why would I waste time crafting an identity for her?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "Other than, well, compassion. And the fact that she still has potential value that outweighs her risks.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "text": "Trust me, there's no harm in getting this sort of candid promise.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "I understand.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "No need to be nervous. I'm simply expressing Laterano's sincerity.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "If you two ever get tired of traveling, Laterano will be here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "Her doors will be open.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "Come in.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "Federico?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "text": "Cardinal Velliv, here are the past two years of records regarding the activities of the former Legatus, Oren Argiolas.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "Thank you, Executor Federico.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "text": "Er...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "Just in case.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "text": "There is reason to believe that Executor Richele may be his accomplice. Should I summon him?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "No need. He'll only claim to have been tricked by an old classmate, now won't he, Oren?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "text": "Remind me never to pick a fight with you again.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "I'll let Richele be. For now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "But I would like to speak with him through you, when it's convenient. You don't have a problem with that, do you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "text": "N-No, not at all.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "Then the two of them have been dealt with for the moment, Executor Federico.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "text": "Hold on, Federico.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "text": "What is it?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "text": "I've been thinking. It couldn't have been easy to deduce that it was Feoria who met with the Sarkaz, just from a few sentences in a journal.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "text": "Why were you so obsessed?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "text": "Who were you seeking?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "text": "...Arturia.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "text": "Arturia... huh? Arturia?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "The wanted criminal?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "text": "What exactly is your relationship with her?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "text": "A distant relative.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "text": "Hahahaha!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "text": "Seriously, man.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "text": "If I could stand right now, I'd be dragging you to the nearest bar.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "text": "I don't have time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "text": "You do, because I happened to run into an infamous fugitive a few years back. By the name of Arturia.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Velliv",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "text": "Wait! Calm down, Velliv!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "text": "I wasn't looking for her! It was a coincidence!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "text": "Seriously, I like to think of myself as a veteran, but just thinking back on that experience sends a shiver down my spine.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Federico",
      "text": "Where did you see her?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Oren",
      "text": "Three years ago, in Leithanien.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "text": "Mister Ezell!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "Cecelia!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "Richele...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "text": "The paperwork is in order. She's now free to leave Laterano.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "Thank you, Richele.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "text": "Just doing my job.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "text": "You know where you're going, right?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "Well, we'll meet up with Federico and join a company by the name of Rhodes Island under a cooperation agreement. Apparently, it's more convenient this way, since we'll be spending a lot of time outside.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "text": "Good. I've already contacted them.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "text": "But you're still an executor of the Notarial Hall. Missions will be issued to you through Rhodes Island when it's inconvenient for you to return.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "text": "That said, I have a hunch that your journey with her will go smoothly. You might find what you're looking for sooner rather than later.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "text": "And my hunches are usually right.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "Er, thanks?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "text": "I'll be going, then. Goodbye, Cecelia.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "text": "Bye-bye, Mister Richele.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "text": "Ah-choo!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Richele",
      "text": "Yikes. I'm getting a hunch that something bad's gonna happen...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "Richele is an eccentric one too.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "Hey, wait, how did he know that we're looking for something?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "text": "What's wrong, Mister Ezell?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "Nothing.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "Is there anything else you want to say before we go?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The girl lets go of the young Sankta's hand and walks to the center of the flower field."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "text": "(I'm leaving Laterano, Mamma.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "text": "(But I'm not running away.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "text": "(I'm gonna find Papà on my own, and tell him what you said.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "text": "(I wanna see the outside world for myself... I wanna see Kazdel.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "text": "(I'm happy, Mamma. Now, just like before...)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "text": "(Please, watch over me.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "text": "Can I pick a white flower?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sister",
      "text": "Of course.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "text": "Thank you!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "You want to take this flower?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "text": "Uh-huh.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "Fresh flowers won't last long. I can press it for you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "text": "Will you teach me? I wanna learn for myself.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "text": "Thanks, Mister Ezell.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "Huh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "I'm the one who should be thanking you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "text": "Eh? Is that...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Andoain",
      "text": "Patia, are you really coming with me?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patia",
      "text": "Of course.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Andoain",
      "text": "I was thinking you could stay here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patia",
      "text": "Laterano doesn't have what I'm looking for.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patia",
      "text": "...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Andoain",
      "text": "What is it, Patia?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patia",
      "text": "Excuse me, that was out of line.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patia",
      "text": "But... did you just smile?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patia",
      "text": "Not to say that you don't normally—it's just that, well, something seems different.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Andoain",
      "text": "Hmm...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Andoain",
      "text": "For many years, I thought we walked alone in the wilderness. I was arrogant and immature.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Andoain",
      "text": "Did you hear the old man's speech?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patia",
      "text": "I heard the second half when it woke me up. It was being broadcast all over the city. Loudly.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Andoain",
      "text": "Yvangelista, the Patron Saint of Sacrifice and Unity. Perhaps he will go even further than the ten who took that name before him.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Andoain",
      "text": "What a grand, yet fragile vision.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Andoain",
      "text": "But one upon which I offer my blessings.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patia",
      "text": "What did you learn that day?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Andoain",
      "text": "It's not important, Patia. Not so important, anyway.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Andoain",
      "text": "Even if there is no reward waiting at the end of the journey, the act of continuing onward is, in itself, carrying the torch. Therefore, I will continue onward.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Andoain",
      "text": "We do not trade for blessings, nor for pity. We walk the path that we believe in.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Andoain",
      "text": "Because... it is the only way to live with dignity, is it not?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rosella",
      "text": "We should depart, Guide, before the sun sets.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Andoain",
      "text": "Let us go, my brothers and sisters.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ezell",
      "text": "What are you looking at, Cecelia?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "text": "No, nothing.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cecelia",
      "text": "The sunset is beautiful.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
